      "w": 380,
      "size": "m",
      "fill": "orange",
      "text": "APPROVED direction (D1–D7, 2026-11-07). Specification: docs/design/ in the ChitChat-Mobile repo. An AMOLED black theme is required before going live. Sample names and content are fictional. Room previews, liveliness glow in lists and admin reports cards depend on data the API does not yet provide; see the dependency notes in the spec."
    },
